EN:
It's the night {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Jingle{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} comes to town!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I've had a warm feeling in my chest
since early this morning.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}It isn't heartburn, though! {{TAG:0003:0005:}}It's just
