{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Speriamo che non sia tachicardia{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
